    "final_prefactor": "d_r^2*p*(1-p)*a_r*c_r is strictly positive because every edge spectrum and both inheritance branches are strict.",
    "minor_division": "Every removed monomial is a product of strict edge spectra and lambda_1, hence is positive on D3+.",
    "ratio_branches": "For every r with {r,s,t}={C,G,T}, vanishing forces b_r in {b_t/b_s,b_s/b_t}."
